WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:05.610
Lately, lots of people have been illegally downloading TV shows over the internet.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:10.990
Without the rights owner's permission,
distribution via bootlegs is...

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:13.400
illegal!

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.990
Please watch out!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.420
You're the one who needs to watch out,
you poor excuse for a magical girl!

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.630
Morning!

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.800
Hakone, let's go to school!

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.550
Okay, I'll be there in a sec.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.810
Senny... I hope you'll like it.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:46.520
Hey, morning.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.270
Senny... morning.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:52.820
Sorry for this, Iono. Hakone
will be done in a minute.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:53.740
It's fine.

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.570
After all, I really make it a point
of coming here every morning.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:59.160
Hey, Senny...

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:01.540
This...

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:05.290
What's up?

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.960
Nothing.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.290
What's with that stupid look of yours?

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:12.340
And when will you ever get a girlfriend anyway?

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:13.420
Quit it.

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:16.890
Talk to me like that when
you've finally got a boyfriend.

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:21.220
Jerk.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.230
Forget it!

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:31.730
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:31.730
Miracles are right beside reality

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.820
Kanarazu aru

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.820
They're there for sure

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:46.160
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:46.160
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:52.090
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:52.090
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:58.010
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:58.010
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:04.180
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:04.180
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:05.600
Hitori janai

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:05.600
You're not alone

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:11.860
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:11.860
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:17.820
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:17.820
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:23.740
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:23.740
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:29.750
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:29.750
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:35.590
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:35.590
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:43.390
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:43.390
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.070
Iono, I've been thinking...

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:00.700
About what?

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.120
You still haven't confessed to my brother, have you?

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.240
Why are you asking me that all of the sudden?!

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.040
It's not sudden at all.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.420
I've always been very concerned about this.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:14.710
I think, since it's you, I can
safely leave him to your care.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.460
Leave him to my care, you say?

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:18.920
And if I weren't here, what then?

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:22.180
If that were the case,
I'd take care of him all by myself!

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:28.310
You know, Hakone, you've
become much more blunt lately.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:31.440
You used to give off the "quiet girl" vibe.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:32.980
You think so?

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.230
I don't really know why,

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.780
but I feel better than I used to.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.280
Maybe it's because Mom's
watching over me from above.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.740
Just kidding!

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:44.950
Anyway, let me give you some advice...

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.870
...from a much happier me:

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.040
You come by every morning,

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.750
so you should tell him you like him.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.420
I'm rooting for you, you know?

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.050
You can count on my support.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:00.010
Thanks, Hakone, but...

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:02.800
For now, I think it's better to maintain the status quo.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:06.470
I'm fine with you being my
excuse to see him every morning.

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:09.220
I'll tell him someday, I promise.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.140
That's just so corny of you!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:14.190
Hey, cut me some slack here!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.700
Iono, Crisis!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.700
Iono, Crisis!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.530
I had no idea...

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:28.660
...that a girl like her would have
the hots for that barbarian.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.200
And...

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:34.920
She's a childhood friend of both Sentou and Hakone.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.290
And even though Iono is all lovey-dovey with Sentou,

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.510
he seems to be oblivious to her advances on him.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.760
A childhood friend...

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.180
I can't let my guard down, then.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.890
What do you mean?

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.260
It's nothing!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:50.220
You two!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.180
Sorry for barging in!

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:55.690
Didn't I make it clear? Stop
crashing here whenever you like!

00:04:55.690 --> 00:05:00.020
I'm innocent! It was Plug!
She insisted I come here and...

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:01.360
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.900
I'm definitely not using Plug as an excuse to see you.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:07.200
My, you're such a ladies' man...

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.660
What the hell?

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.740
Sure is tough being so popular with the girls, huh?

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:12.620
Stop it.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.580
Enough, already!

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:24.130
Fine. Stay if you like, but don't you guys have work to do?

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.680
Wouldn't want your boss to eat you alive.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:28.050
I-I know that.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.680
I was just about to change into my suit.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.140
<i>Change?</i>

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.100
Right, right. I got it!

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.770
Hey, Plug!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.730
You just changed in front of a guy!

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:43.400
A guy?

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:44.650
Where?

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.070
This is weird...

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:51.450
<i>I've always been working with girls,
so I really never gave it much thought.</i>

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.490
<i>But when you change into that suit...</i>

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.330
<i>...isn't that akin to getting all naked?</i>

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:58.460
<i>Right in front of him...?</i>

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.630
Don't "where" me!

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.250
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.090
<i>They're just my work clothes.</i>

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.470
<i>I'm not slutty at all.</i>

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.890
<i>I'm not slutty...</i>

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.140
<i>Not slutty!</i>

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.060
<i>But...</i>

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:15.020
<i>But it's...</i>

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.270
<i>It's...</i>

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.270
<i>It's so embarrassing...</i>

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.400
This transformation sequence took 0.01 seconds.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.700
Done.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.200
See, it's like this.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.950
What the hell are you doing?!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.540
But you know...

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:42.500
The more I look at you, the more I realize
you've got what it takes to be my type, Alesta.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:45.510
<i>He's looking at me.</i>

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:46.210
<i>I'm letting him look.</i>

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.470
<i>I'm being looked at!</i>

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.840
<i>It's so strange...</i>

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:53.510
<i>Why do I feel like this?</i>

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:57.060
Let's look at the transformation scene one more time.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.020
Stop it, bitch!

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:06.150
Hurry up and get to work!

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.570
This is Iono's school!

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:13.200
Student Council Room

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.420
<i>Again, I couldn't give it to him...</i>

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.800
<i>This can't go on like this.</i>

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:32.140
<i>At this rate, I'll be his childhood friend forever.</i>

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:37.720
<i>But the thought of ruining our friendship... scares me.</i>

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.270
Iono, you're not going home yet?

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:45.520
Yeah, just a bit longer.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.320
I'm having trouble balancing the student council budget.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.280
You're the last one here, so please lock up, okay?

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.360
Got it!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.620
Alright, let's finish the rest in one stretch!

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:00.330
Student Council Room

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.180
Someone broke into the school?

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.260
Our school?

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:16.470
No way!

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.350
But they ignored all the places that were locked.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:22.270
What? Nothing was stolen, right?

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.400
Well, something was...

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.230
Student Council Room

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.190
And it was from the student council room.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.330
Iono hasn't come back?

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.080
Yeah, she feels really guilty.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:44.540
She thinks it's her fault for losing the school's budget.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.460
Iono...

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:54.180
I can't find any targets...

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.800
At this rate, my income will be affected again.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:58.640
Depression level C!

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.100
Where are you?

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.180
Iono?

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.440
Iono!

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.280
Senny...

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:20.410
I can't just butt in on them now.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.580
I got the gist of what happened from Hakone.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.080
Sounds very unfortunate.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.960
Well... cheer up.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.500
I can't, don't feel like it...

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.880
Let me be alone for now.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.130
I won't allow that!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.970
If I let you be,

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:37.340
you'll start hating yourself to the point of depression.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:40.350
Where have I heard that before...

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:43.270
I-I'm not that fragile.

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.520
All the same, I'm not leaving you alone.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.730
I'm staying with you.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:48.310
Got it?

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.860
You still haven't confessed to my brother, have you?

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:57.610
<i>I-I can't. Not now...</i>

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:59.740
<i>The reason I made the mistake was because...</i>

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:03.870
<i>...Senny was all that was on mind that time. But...</i>

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.830
Who cares why it happened?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:10.670
More importantly, Hakone's really worried about you.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:14.800
And to be honest, I hate seeing you depressed like this.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:17.510
Senny...

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.850
<i>But, if it's now...</i>

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.640
Senny, I...

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.560
Tell me if there's anything I can do to help.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:32.650
You're like a little sister to me, after all.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:39.070
Yeah, I got it.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:43.370
Excuse me.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.660
I gotta go home now.

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:47.250
Hey, wait, Iono!

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.670
Just leave me alone!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:50.670
Iono...

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:53.880
Iono!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:12.690
He's friends with a cute girl,
and he calls her a little sister?

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:16.730
That's worse than being a childhood friend.

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:18.280
Stupid Sentou.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.740
Iono...

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.910
No... I'm the idiot.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:26.290
They even took the present I wanted to give him.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:37.010
I was so sure I'd be able to give it
to him the next time I met him.

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:38.800
What a fool I am.

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:43.140
You really like him a lot, don't you?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:46.510
Don't fret! I'll charge you up right now!

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.390
This'll fix everything!

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:49.770
Yeah, I should give up.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.610
I should give up on him.

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:57.280
There's nothing wrong with being a
childhood friend or little sister to him.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.940
Iono...

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:07.040
<i>If I charge her up now,
she really will give up on him!</i>

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:10.040
<i>I can't... do that.</i>

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.710
Senny!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:21.050
Wash basin drop!

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:24.300
Brother!

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.560
What did you say to upset Iono?

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:30.560
When I called her, she seemed very depressed.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.770
I didn't say anything, I swear.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:35.940
I just told her that she's like a little sister and could ask me for anything.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.150
A little sister?

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:38.900
That's what you called her?

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.740
But she is, isn't she?

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:42.450
I think of her as...

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:44.610
Hakone?

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.620
You're so stupid!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.580
What's with her?

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:53.000
Really!

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.670
Why are you upset as well?

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:56.710
Why, you ask?

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.380
The same reason Hakone is!

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.800
You're an idiot, Sentou!

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:00.460
What's that?!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.550
Really, that stupid brother of mine...

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.760
I don't want to hear flak from you!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:11.560
But why is everyone calling me an idiot?!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.140
I don't get it!

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:19.860
How can you not understand?

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:23.740
But if he's that dense, it's possible
nothing I say will get through.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.490
What can I do to make her happy again?

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.660
I guess I'll watch some TV first.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.250
That's as far as you go, Tuxedo Thief!

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.300
Return everything you stole from
the townsfolk right this instant!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.180
Bitch is right!

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:49.800
The treasure embodies the people's love and hope.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.430
I, Milly, will get it back!

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.850
I'll retrieve everyone's smiles!

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:56.020
That's it!

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:04.740
<i>That sensor sound I heard was Plug, I bet.</i>

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:09.740
<i>Iono.</i>

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:15.580
Sorry about that earlier.
I didn't mean to clobber you.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.330
Anyway, about Iono...

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:20.080
Show some spine, dammit!

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:23.250
Your effort isn't worth a box of expired love from the bottom of the discount rack!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:25.050
You filthy bitch!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.720
I won't lose!

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:29.180
It's so sticky...

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.050
Plug?

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:47.490
With this, I'll be able to bring back her smile!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.030
I was so sure I'd be able to give it
to him the next time I met him.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.620
<i>If she gets the gift back,</i>

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.500
<i>I'm sure she won't give up on Sentou!</i>

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.120
<i>Hold on, Iono!</i>

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:03.550
<i>I'll bring back the symbol of your love!</i>

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:08.050
Sentou, take care of the front desk next.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.800
Gotcha.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.520
Then take out the trash, clean out the back.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:20.140
After that, get the windows cleaned...

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.690
Sentou?

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:32.070
Okay, time to try out the latest tech from Life Core!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.910
Neodym's latest life checker!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.290
Not only does it have the ability to measure depression degrees more accurately,

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.460
it also finds targets in need of charging.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:44.590
Truly the top-of-the-line Life Core technology!

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:47.670
Now, where are you, Mr. School Burglar?

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.970
Don't underestimate the latest technology from Life Core!

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:54.890
So, like, how do I use this to find the school burglar?

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:59.430
The latest in Life Core technology is useless for anything but charging!

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:03.610
I just have to look for him then!

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:04.610
I just know I can do it!

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:06.320
All I have to do is try!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.870
That hurt!

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.040
Sorry for that.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:26.040
Guess I don't know my own strength.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.670
Sentou!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.550
Slamming me to the road is a
bit too much, don't you think?!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.430
Wasn't that why I apologized?

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:36.220
So, what can I do to help?

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:40.180
I don't really get it, but it's for Iono's sake, isn't it?

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.270
So, I can't just ignore it.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.100
Sentou!

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:49.230
<i>But it's him being dense that caused it all.</i>

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.110
Said something?

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.280
Nothing.

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.320
We're really sorry. Please forgive us!

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:41.580
I guess this may be impossible...

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.250
What are you saying? We're just getting started.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.710
Let's go.

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.540
Let's rest a bit more!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:50.460
Shut it.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:55.260
<i>He's working quite hard for that girl's sake.</i>

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.680
I've still got work to do.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:01.640
Charge!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.140
Charge!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.060
I guess I should turn myself in!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:09.360
Excuse me!

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:12.070
I was the one who burglarized that school!

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.240
The man known as Tarou Yamada...

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:17.990
...could not withstand the guilt and turned himself in...

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.910
...for the crime of robbing a school!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.870
Thus, case closed!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.130
I'm so glad.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.420
That's our Alesta!

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:36.930
Why me?

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:50.270
<i>...like a little sister...</i>

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:52.360
Yeah.

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.650
Iono.

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.450
Why am I hesitating?

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.950
Didn't I decide to give up?

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.630
Hakone?

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.260
<i>Although he told me to keep it a secret,</i>

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:18.550
<i>my brother was looking for the guy who stole from the school.</i>

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:21.090
<i>He wanted to make you feel better.</i>

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:24.810
<i>In the end, he didn't find him, but...</i>

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:27.430
<i>Nonetheless, please forgive my brother!</i>

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:31.560
Senny...

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.270
Fight! In one strike!

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.530
Charge!

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:56.960
Sorry, Iono.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:02.390
But he really does want you to feel better.

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:03.640
So...

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:07.470
Senny!

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.480
I want to ask you something!

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:15.270
Iono?

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.860
<i>She looks so much better.</i>

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.480
<i>Plug must've done it.</i>

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.360
Senny!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.780
What is it?

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.910
Who is a "little sister" to you?

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:24.240
What am I to you?

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:25.660
A little sister?

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:27.200
My little sister's Hakone.

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:28.660
How about me?

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.500
A girl who's my childhood friend?

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.010
I-Iono?

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:48.720
I'm going to change that "childhood friend"
into something else.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.650
Here you go.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:01.240
This is...

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:04.490
A present for my beloved Senny.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.450
Thanks.

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:23.880
Morning, Hakone!

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:26.220
Morning, Iono.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.890
Yo, Iono.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.140
Morning, Senny.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:33.810
Morning...

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:38.730
Good for you, Iono.

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:48.200
But what is Sentou to me?

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:50.540
Well, it doesn't matter!

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:55.460
Why... did it... turn out... like that?!

00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:07.010
Now, for a bonus: Milly's transformation!

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:11.220
Moé flat chest, moé flat chest, Magical Milly Change!

00:22:25.530 --> 00:22:29.120
Now, what did you transform into, Milly?

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:31.700
Yikes, there's no time left!

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:35.000
Then, see you next week! Next week!

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:40.430
Honto wa totemo TOUGH nan da yo

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:40.430
Really, I'm quite tough, you know

00:22:40.430 --> 00:22:43.230
Hitori demo heiki de

00:22:40.430 --> 00:22:43.230
I'm fine even all by myself

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:46.000
Doko ni demo ikeru no

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:46.000
I can go anywhere at all

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:48.760
Koibito nante iranai

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:48.760
I don't need a boyfriend or anything

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:54.260
Takumashiku ikiteikunda to kimetetanda

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:54.260
I decided that I would live strong

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:56.020
Kimi to deau made wa

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:56.020
Until the day I could meet you

00:23:01.260 --> 00:23:04.030
Sore wa arigachi na

00:23:01.260 --> 00:23:04.030
"That really is

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:06.820
Warui kuse da yo

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:06.820
It's a bad habit

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:09.590
Hanashi janai ka? nante

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:09.590
such an often-heard saying, right?"

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:12.390
Toshiue buranaide ne

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:12.390
Don't pretend to be older than you are

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:17.550
Datte ne watashi wa itsumo tokubetsu

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:17.550
But you know, I'm always an exceptional case

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:20.690
Kimi ni mo kitto SPECIAL deshou

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:20.690
I'm sure I'm special to you, too

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:22.410
Sore de nakya iya

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:22.410
I couldn't stand it any other way

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:26.230
Zettai watashi soba ni iru yo

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:26.230
I'll definitely always be beside you

00:23:26.230 --> 00:23:34.260
Kimi ga ochikondara namida fusegu kasa ni naritainda yo

00:23:26.230 --> 00:23:30.350
I want to become the umbrella

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:34.260
that shields you from tears when you're feeling down

00:23:34.560 --> 00:23:39.830
Keredo mamoreteru no wa naze ka watashi bakari

00:23:34.560 --> 00:23:37.190
But why is it that I'm the one

00:23:37.190 --> 00:23:39.830
who always ends up being protected?

00:23:40.150 --> 00:23:46.120
Kimochi no naka no koishi ne tsumazuite korobisou na toki

00:23:40.150 --> 00:23:46.120
At the times when, in my heart, I stumble and seem about to fall

00:23:46.330 --> 00:23:50.850
Itsumo sotto sasaete kureru

00:23:46.330 --> 00:23:50.850
Keep supporting me just a little, always

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:55.360
Futoshita kizuna itoshii yo

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:55.360
I'll treasure this unexpected bond

00:23:55.360 --> 00:23:56.700
Itsumademo

00:23:55.360 --> 00:23:56.700
Now and forever

00:23:57.080 --> 00:24:00.920
Eien Sweetheart

00:23:57.080 --> 00:24:00.920
Eternally, Sweetheart

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:07.210
So what happened after that?

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:09.630
Did Iono confess to Sentou?

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:10.970
She did it superbly!

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:13.300
But Sentou totally ignored it.

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:14.890
What's he thinking?

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:17.020
Don't ask me.

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:18.770
Well, for a dense guy like him,

00:24:18.770 --> 00:24:21.730
I guess a childhood friend still
lacks the impact to shake him.

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:23.440
I see. That's good to know.

